There is a knock at the door.
I open the door.
Frau Krüger is standing in the hallway.
She has a small plant in her hand.
"A gift for the new flat," she says.
"Welcome to your new home, Frau Flores."
"Thank you very much, Frau Krüger," I answer.
"That is very nice of you."
We look for a place for the plant together.
The wide windowsill is perfect.
I put the plant there.
Now the plant stands on the windowsill.
It stands exactly next to the window glass.
"It looks very good here," I say.
"Yes, the plant stands perfectly there," answers Frau Krüger.
We look at the beautiful plant.
My new flat is really a home now.
